{"4821050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kimbap Factory", "steam_appid": 4821050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate the ultimate Korean kitchen. Route belts, watch ingredients transform, and physically assemble each kimbap roll step by step. Discover new recipes, fulfill requests, and expand your kitchen at your own pace. No pressure, no timers, just a satisfying and unique casual factory experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/57c3535d25c23f6ee97fdede99f80262.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Korean comfort food through the lens of a casual factory builder. Kimbap is a beloved Korean dish made by layering rice and fresh ingredients onto a seaweed sheet, rolling it tightly, and slicing it into neat pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/f27760171ea88cee9553e5757052cc74.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan, optimize, and perfect your kitchen layout. Place specialized machines and route conveyor belts to build your dream kitchen, then step back and watch your automated production lines run flawlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/51cf407324ca080344f236a5e5400c5f.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/51cf407324ca080344f236a5e5400c5f.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/51cf407324ca080344f236a5e5400c5f.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/309dd318a765975f1e4b4dc92d5a4d16.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ingredient in your kitchen is processed right before your eyes. Enjoy as you watch raw ingredients get peeled, chopped, and shredded as they travel down the belt, offering instant feedback on the state of your automated lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/b27452137ab60b64dcf2ccca43eff6ee.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/b27452137ab60b64dcf2ccca43eff6ee.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/b27452137ab60b64dcf2ccca43eff6ee.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/edb3d32ec3d21b22893f6d2eea111c91.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine processed ingredients to create the perfect kimbap. Watch your machines physically stack, roll, and slice each dish in real time as you master dozens of recipes featuring diverse vegetables, meats, and seafood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/aff78e7745f9d1ede7f8b51370d850b8.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/aff78e7745f9d1ede7f8b51370d850b8.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/aff78e7745f9d1ede7f8b51370d850b8.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/9adfbf6a6e2e1d66636fc7e06b91fe84.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no timers, enemies, or stressful fail states, discover the missing recipes your grandmother left behind to complete her cookbook. Fulfill requests from the surrounding villages to progress, unlock new ingredients and machinery, and bring the abandoned house back to life as you expand your production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/0f6bc7534d1f09c2fb474710e1926f57.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/0f6bc7534d1f09c2fb474710e1926f57.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/0f6bc7534d1f09c2fb474710e1926f57.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/e56d122c8b845192e1520599a0d8d79d.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frictionless Building Tools:</strong> Freely design, demolish, and rebuild with zero penalties. Utilize intuitive copy, paste, undo, and redo tools to experiment without the fear of losing resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large-Scale Simulation:</strong> Build a sprawling, highly optimized kitchen. The system meticulously tracks and simulates every ingredient across your conveyor belts in real time, no matter how large your kitchen grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Diagnostics:</strong> Gauge your kitchen's health without menus. Spot bottlenecks, broken connections, and supply shortages at a glance across your conveyor belts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Unfinished Cookbook:</strong> Chart your path toward the ultimate secret recipe. Discover missing pages to carry on your grandmother's legacy, uncovering dozens of new tasty recipes to automate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Interactive Databook:</strong> Unlock detailed entries for every newly produced ingredient. Study exact processing chains and discover potential future transformations to plan your kitchen layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Upgrades:</strong> Increase belt speeds and machine throughput, relieve kitchen congestion, and improve efficiency without needing to completely rebuild your lines.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate the ultimate Korean kitchen. Route belts, watch ingredients transform, and physically assemble each kimbap roll step by step. Discover new recipes, fulfill requests, and expand your kitchen at your own pace. No pressure, no timers, just a satisfying and unique casual factory experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/57c3535d25c23f6ee97fdede99f80262.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Korean comfort food through the lens of a casual factory builder. Kimbap is a beloved Korean dish made by layering rice and fresh ingredients onto a seaweed sheet, rolling it tightly, and slicing it into neat pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.poster.avif?t=1788148675\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.webm?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/extras/22954c7c12eaa95540ab5a4f9f4415a7.mp4?t=1788148675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=