okbook:</strong> Chart your path toward the ultimate secret recipe. Discover missing pages to carry on your grandmother's legacy, uncovering dozens of new tasty recipes to automate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Interactive Databook:</strong> Unlock detailed entries for every newly produced ingredient. Study exact processing chains and discover potential future transformations to plan your kitchen layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitchen Upgrades:</strong> Increase belt speeds and machine throughput, relieve kitchen congestion, and improve efficiency without needing to completely rebuild your lines.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Automate the ultimate Korean kitchen. Route belts, watch ingredients transform, and physically assemble each kimbap roll step by step. Discover new recipes, fulfill requests, and expand your kitchen at your own pace. No pressure, no timers, just a satisfying and unique casual factory experience.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/4613f8b85ea5ce0c6633b6d372782d1d6d9af5d8/header.jpg?t=1788148675", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/b7a3055b581c68765a25f089eeec0634887bcac2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788148675", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4821050/b7a3055b581c68765a25f089eeec0634887bcac2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788148675", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</